OL,3,GNEWSADriver reached 115mph after
OL,4,Aovertaking police car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorist who drove at more than
OL,7,F115mph (185km/h) after overtaking an
OL,8,Funmarked police car has been jailed.
OL,10,FJohnpaul Allen, who had a child in the
OL,11,Fpassenger seat, narrowly avoided an
OL,12,Foncoming car when he swerved past the
OL,13,Fpolice vehicle on the A60 between
OL,14,FWorksop and Cuckney on 25 May,
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police said.
OL,17,FThe 32-year-old, who was driving a
OL,18,FRange Rover Sport, was followed by
OL,19,Fofficers before eventually coming to a
OL,20,Fstop when he was detained.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
