OL,3,GNEWSADriver reached 115mph after
OL,4,Aovertaking police car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllen, of Park Hall Road, Mansfield
OL,7,FWoodhouse, pleaded guilty to dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving and on 15 September at
OL,9,FNottingham Crown Court he was jailed
OL,10,Ffor six months and banned from holding
OL,11,Fa licence for 16 months.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
